                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A Circle is divided into points. Longest List repeats the pattern 1,0,1,0 over the points, so every second point is pushed outward along its own direction (Vector + Amplitude) by Star depth. A closed PolyLine joins them into a star and Fillet rounds the corners.</item>
